Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it outperforms best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the stable pool1 to see if it beats the single ETS baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool2 to see if it improves on best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a dynamic Bayesian average on the more diverse pool3 to see if it improves over the best single ETS baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse‑error combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it can beat best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on pool4 to see if it beats the best_single ETS baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‐mean combination on pool4 to see if trimming the extremes improves over mean/median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the highly stable pool4 to see if it beats best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"]}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool3 to see if adding the catboost and DWT_rf models improves over pool4 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on pool4 to see if it improves over the current best_single ETS baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool4","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the most stable pool1 to see if it can beat the current best_single ETS baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 on the full pool to see if a sophisticated weighting beats the ETS baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"w1"}

